"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nA place we visited on our guide's recommendation.  \nWe ordered both dishes our guide recommended without hesitation.  \n\nWhen ordering the Charred Octopus Salad, they didn't catch it at first due to our pronunciation and accent.  \n\nProbably because you can bring your own wine for a small corkage fee, even on a weekday afternoon many people were enjoying wine and making plenty of noise.  \nIt seemed like the kind of place that locals would claim as their go-to spot.  \n\nThe sauce on the Eye Fillet with Mushroom Sauce was, as expected, delicious.  \nThere was a subtle hint of egg yolk flavor that made me want to try recreating it at home.  \n\nThe Charred Octopus Salad had the octopus cooked to just the right degree, giving it a perfect texture and flavor.  \n\nBoth dishes were satisfying, and it's a place I'd highly recommend.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"